docs/nit-269-handoff.md:1:# NIT-269 handoff — personalised Tailor agent proof
docs/nit-269-handoff.md:15:| `src/tailor/` | Reusable core: `core.ts` (`createTailorCore(adapter)`, the turn loop), `adapter.ts` (the `ProductAdapter` contract, types only), `contract.ts` (browser-safe limits, chat/turn shapes, provider, knowledge and telemetry seams), `lifecycle.ts`, `spend.ts` (ledger), `anthropic-transport.ts` (generic JSON-schema structured call), `provider-error.ts`, `claims.ts`, small helpers. No Neatlogs, trace, span or scenario vocabulary. |
